{
  "name": "building-destruction-visual",
  "description": "Visual check of building destruction via blast: drill, charge, sequence, and detonate near warehouses. #553: drill_plan no longer writes holes instantly — a staffed driller/drill_rig must physically reach and drill each hole, so the two holes are ordered ON OPEN GROUND (via drill_plan add, one per building origin) and landed BEFORE either warehouse is built. Building a warehouse first would leave its footprint permanently un-navigable to the not-yet-drilled hole underneath it (buildings occupy blocked NavGrid cells; only an already-drilled hole's cell reclassifies to the walkable 'drill_hole' type) — a driller/drill_rig sent to drill under a standing building can never physically arrive there, so drill-then-build is not just tidier ordering here but the only sequence that can complete at all.",
  "steps": [
    {
      "command": "new_game seed:42 staffed:true",
      "timeout": 30,
      "description": "Staffed opening (#551): a driller with blasting + drill_rig licence, plus an unmanned drill_rig, are hired/purchased for free at game-open — exactly what #553's automatic drill dispatch needs.",
      "interaction": [
        {
          "type": "command",
          "command": "new_game seed:42 staffed:true"
        }
      ],
      "role": "setup",
      "expect": {
        "equals": {
          "cash": 50000,
          "holeCount": 0,
          "orderedHoleCount": 0,
          "buildingCount": 0
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "command": "drill_plan add x:20 z:20 depth:6 diameter:0.089",
      "description": "Ordered on open ground, before either warehouse exists (#553) — the single-hole add tool, not the grid tool, since the two target holes (exactly the warehouse origins below) aren't a rectangular pattern worth dragging. diameter:0.089 added (issue #553 shared-mechanism finding, same root cause as rock-fragmenter-breaking.json/hauling-gate.json/nav-*-visual.json): the real add-hole-tool confirm always sends the panel's own DEFAULT_DIAMETER_M=0.089 (Drill.ts), while an omitted diameter: on this console command fell back to a different console-only default (0.15, mining.ts) -- computeDrillHoleDurationTicks scales drill duration by diameter, so the omission alone kept the drill_rig busy (and paying fuelCostPerTick) for extra ticks in command mode that the real click never spent.",
      "interaction": [
        {
          "type": "clickSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-toolbar [data-panel=\"blast\"]"
        },
        {
          "type": "clickSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-blast-panel [data-action=\"add-hole-tool\"]"
        },
        {
          "type": "waitForSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-tile-select-confirm"
        },
        {
          "type": "pickTile",
          "x": 20,
          "z": 20
        },
        {
          "type": "screenshot"
        },
        {
          "type": "clickSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-tile-select-confirm"
        }
      ],
      "role": "player",
      "expect": {
        "equals": {
          "orderedHoleCount": 1,
          "holeCount": 0
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "command": "drill_plan add x:25 z:25 depth:6 diameter:0.089",
      "description": "BlastWorkshop auto-advances Drill -> Charge once a hole exists, so a second use of the Drill tools needs an explicit click back to the Drill tab ([data-step=\"1\"]) first, same as blast-drill-plan-ui.json's second grid use. diameter:0.089 added (issue #553 shared-mechanism finding): same fix as H1 above.",
      "interaction": [
        {
          "type": "clickSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-blast-panel [data-step=\"1\"]"
        },
        {
          "type": "waitForSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-blast-panel [data-action=\"add-hole-tool\"]"
        },
        {
          "type": "clickSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-blast-panel [data-action=\"add-hole-tool\"]"
        },
        {
          "type": "waitForSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-tile-select-confirm"
        },
        {
          "type": "pickTile",
          "x": 25,
          "z": 25
        },
        {
          "type": "screenshot"
        },
        {
          "type": "clickSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-tile-select-confirm"
        }
      ],
      "role": "player",
      "expect": {
        "equals": {
          "orderedHoleCount": 2,
          "holeCount": 0
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "command": "drill_plan show",
      "interaction": [
        {
          "type": "command",
          "command": "drill_plan show"
        }
      ],
      "role": "observe"
    },
    {
      "command": "tick 50",
      "description": "#553: drain the ordered plan on open ground — both holes land well inside this pad (observed landing at tick 46, sandbox-measured). Kept as tight as the observed landing tick (plus a small margin) rather than a large round number: the staffed roster's ongoing salary/fuel cost burns real cash every tick with no income in this scenario, and the two warehouses built right after this step need $35,000 of what's left of the starting $50,000.",
      "interaction": [
        {
          "type": "command",
          "command": "tick 50"
        },
        {
          "type": "screenshot"
        }
      ],
      "role": "setup",
      "expect": {
        "equals": {
          "orderedHoleCount": 0,
          "holeCount": 2
        },
        "note": "Both holes have landed — none lost, none left ordered forever."
      }
    },
    {
      "command": "build explosive_warehouse at:20,20",
      "interaction": [
        {
          "type": "clickSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-toolbar [data-panel=\"build\"]"
        },
        {
          "type": "clickSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-build-panel [data-build-type=\"explosive_warehouse\"] .bs-build-buy-btn"
        },
        {
          "type": "waitForSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-tile-select-confirm"
        },
        {
          "type": "pickTile",
          "x": 20,
          "z": 20
        },
        {
          "type": "screenshot"
        },
        {
          "type": "clickSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-tile-select-confirm"
        }
      ],
      "role": "player",
      "description": "#553: built directly on top of hole H1's now-drilled cell — placeBuilding only checks bounds/other-building occupancy, not NavGrid cell type, so a landed drill_hole cell is a legal building site.",
      "expect": {
        "changedBy": {
          "cash": -20000
        },
        "equals": {
          "buildingCount": 1
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "command": "build freight_warehouse at:25,25",
      "interaction": [
        {
          "type": "clickSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-build-panel [data-build-type=\"freight_warehouse\"] .bs-build-buy-btn"
        },
        {
          "type": "waitForSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-tile-select-confirm"
        },
        {
          "type": "pickTile",
          "x": 25,
          "z": 25
        },
        {
          "type": "screenshot"
        },
        {
          "type": "clickSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-tile-select-confirm"
        }
      ],
      "role": "player",
      "expect": {
        "changedBy": {
          "cash": -15000
        },
        "equals": {
          "buildingCount": 2
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "command": "build list",
      "interaction": [
        {
          "type": "command",
          "command": "build list"
        }
      ],
      "role": "observe"
    },
    {
      "command": "charge hole:* explosive:boomite amount:8 stemming:1",
      "interaction": [
        {
          "type": "clickSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-toolbar [data-panel=\"blast\"]"
        },
        {
          "type": "clickSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-blast-panel [data-step=\"2\"]"
        },
        {
          "type": "clickSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-blast-panel [data-action=\"select-explosive\"][data-explosive=\"boomite\"]"
        },
        {
          "type": "clickSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-blast-panel [data-field=\"amount\"] .bsx-stepper-btn:last-child"
        },
        {
          "type": "clickSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-blast-panel [data-field=\"amount\"] .bsx-stepper-btn:last-child"
        },
        {
          "type": "clickSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-blast-panel [data-field=\"amount\"] .bsx-stepper-btn:last-child"
        },
        {
          "type": "clickSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-blast-panel [data-field=\"stemming\"] .bsx-stepper-btn:first-child"
        },
        {
          "type": "clickSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-blast-panel [data-field=\"stemming\"] .bsx-stepper-btn:first-child"
        },
        {
          "type": "clickSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-blast-panel [data-field=\"stemming\"] .bsx-stepper-btn:first-child"
        },
        {
          "type": "clickSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-blast-panel [data-field=\"stemming\"] .bsx-stepper-btn:first-child"
        },
        {
          "type": "clickSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-blast-panel [data-field=\"stemming\"] .bsx-stepper-btn:first-child"
        },
        {
          "type": "assert",
          "selector": "#bs-blast-panel [data-action=\"select-explosive\"][data-explosive=\"boomite\"][data-selected=\"true\"]"
        },
        {
          "type": "assert",
          "selector": "#bs-blast-panel [data-field=\"amount\"] .bsx-stepper-value",
          "property": "textContent",
          "expectedValue": "8 kg"
        },
        {
          "type": "assert",
          "selector": "#bs-blast-panel [data-field=\"stemming\"] .bsx-stepper-value",
          "property": "textContent",
          "expectedValue": "1.0 m"
        },
        {
          "type": "clickSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-blast-panel [data-action=\"charge-all\"]"
        }
      ],
      "description": "role: player (issue #515): the Charge step's amount/stemming steppers and product-card explosive selector are real controls — this reaches the declared explosive/amount/stemming via clicks instead of Charge All using whatever the panel's fields already showed.",
      "expect": {
        "equals": {
          "chargedCount": 2
        }
      },
      "role": "player"
    },
    {
      "command": "sequence auto delay_step:25",
      "interaction": [
        {
          "type": "clickSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-blast-panel [data-step=\"3\"]"
        },
        {
          "type": "clickSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-blast-panel [data-action=\"auto-sequence\"]"
        }
      ],
      "role": "player",
      "expect": {
        "equals": {
          "sequencedCount": 2
        }
      },
      "description": "role: player: explicit [data-step=\"3\"] click before Sequence controls -- relying on the panel's own autoAdvance to have already landed there is unreliable in a real interaction-mode run (element present but zero-size, i.e. a hidden inactive tab), same finding as level1-win-efficient.json/level1-playthrough-win.json/tutorial-playthrough.json."
    },
    {
      "command": "blast",
      "timeout": 30,
      "frames": 6,
      "interval": 50,
      "interaction": [
        {
          "type": "clickSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-blast-panel [data-action=\"execute\"]"
        },
        {
          "type": "waitForSelector",
          "selector": ".bs-confirm-overlay .bs-btn-danger"
        },
        {
          "type": "clickSelector",
          "selector": ".bs-confirm-overlay .bs-btn-danger"
        },
        {
          "type": "waitForSelector",
          "selector": "[data-action=\"report-close\"]"
        },
        {
          "type": "clickSelector",
          "selector": "[data-action=\"report-close\"]"
        }
      ],
      "role": "player",
      "expect": {
        "equals": {
          "holeCount": 0,
          "chargedCount": 0,
          "sequencedCount": 0,
          "buildingCount": 0
        },
        "note": "both warehouses (200/150 max HP) sit exactly on the two charged holes and get destroyed — the file's own stated purpose, confirmed via a real dump (blast rating CATASTROPHIC, 'Buildings destroyed: explosive_warehouse #1, freight_warehouse #2')"
      }
    },
    {
      "command": "build list",
      "interaction": [
        {
          "type": "command",
          "command": "build list"
        }
      ],
      "role": "observe"
    },
    {
      "command": "fragments",
      "interaction": [
        {
          "type": "command",
          "command": "fragments"
        }
      ],
      "role": "observe"
    },
    {
      "command": "scores",
      "interaction": [
        {
          "type": "command",
          "command": "scores"
        }
      ],
      "role": "observe"
    },
    {
      "command": "state full",
      "interaction": [
        {
          "type": "command",
          "command": "state full"
        }
      ],
      "role": "observe"
    }
  ],
  "shots": [
    {
      "name": "overview",
      "yaw": 0,
      "pitch": 45
    },
    {
      "name": "pre-blast",
      "yaw": 90,
      "pitch": 10
    },
    {
      "name": "post-blast",
      "yaw": 45,
      "pitch": 30
    },
    {
      "name": "destruction-closeup",
      "yaw": 0,
      "pitch": 80
    }
  ]
}
